| ===========================================================================
| lowmem_se.inc -- Mac SE low-memory globals and overrides (both SE ROMs)
|
| Auto-generated by tools/derive_se_lowmem.py from the FDisasm symbolic
| disassembly preserved in src/rom_se_amalgamated.s. Each address is
| decoded from the trailing extension words of the FDisasm hex-bytes column
| where the SE FDHD ROM uses an absolute-mode operand referring to the
| named symbol.
|
| Override section: addresses where SE FDHD differs from the Plus / Original
| values in the shared lowmem.inc / private.inc / etc. The `.set` directive
| allows redefinition of the value for the SE builds.
|
| New section: addresses introduced in SE-era hardware/Toolbox that the
| Plus-era include files do not define (ADB stack, Sound Manager, MacroMaker,
| FDHD/SuperDrive, etc.).
|
| Included from src/rom_se_amalgamated.s after lowmem.inc and private.inc.
| ===========================================================================

| --- Overrides (different address than Plus) ---
